<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The notification small icon. capacitor.config.ts has referenced ic_stat_icon
  since it was written and the resource never existed, so every notification
  this app has posted fell back to the platform default.

  Android draws a small icon as a silhouette: it keeps the alpha and throws the
  colours away, so this is the monochrome mark in one ink.

  It is NOT the adaptive foreground at a smaller size. Nothing masks a status
  bar icon again, so the 66dp safe-zone inset the foreground needs is pure
  wasted margin here - it shipped that way once and the mark filled about half
  its box. The group below scales the mark back out to fill the frame the way
  Material's own small icons do.
-->
